        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia yachesiyia Zedekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa elieetsela Yeremia okhurula khuMWAMI, olwa Nebukhadineza omuruchi waBabeli, nelihelie liosi, naboburuchi bwosi bwebialo obwali mubunyalibwe, baseera Yerusalemu namataala kalio kosi, ndielino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Tsia osungane naZedekia omuruchi waYuda, omuboolele ori Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Lola, ehaana litookho lino mumukhono kwomuruchi waBabeli, naye alalisamba nomulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shioleehonokokha mumukhonokwe ta, ne olabukulwa nohaanwa mumukhonokwe; tsimonitsio tsilalola tsimoni tsiomuruchi waBabeli, naye alasungana ninawe, omunwa khumunwa, ne olatsia eBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa hulila likhuwa liOMWAMI, iwe Zedekia omuruchi waYuda; kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola khukoko; mbu shiolifwa khulwa olukanga ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olifwila mumulembe; ne shinga olwa basambila abakuukabo, abaruchi bakhale abakhuranjilila, nolwa balakhusambila iwe amaleesi; ne balakhwikhuula, bari Bayaye, Omwami! Okhuba okhuboola emboolile; nilwo olwa OMWAMI asunga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yeremia omunabii yaboolela Zedekia omuruchi waYuda amakhuwa ako kosi eYerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olwa lihe liomuruchi waBabeli liaseerana nende Yerusalemu namataala kosi kaYuda akali nikasikaale, mbu Lakhishi nende Azeka; okhuba khumataala ketsingoba kaYuda, niko konyene akatong'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Indakano khukabakholi abakula abali abaHeburania yoonoonibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa elieetsela Yeremia okhurula khuMWAMI, olwa omuruchi Zedekia yali nalakaane indakano nende abandu bosi abali eYerusalemu, okhubarumbulila akobulekhuuli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu buli mundu alekhuule omusumbawe nomukholiwe omukula oweshikhasi, naba nali omuHeburania; mbu omundu yesi aleshe okhumukhola omusumba omuYahudi omwana wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abakhulundu nende abandu bosi nibahulila, abo bosi abali nibeenjiile mundakano tsana mbu buli mundu alekhuule omusumbawe kata omukholiwe oweshikhasi, baleshe okhubakhola abasumba khandi ta; bahulila, nibabalekhuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa olunyumakhwo bashiukhana, nibakalusia abasumba abo nabakholi beshikhasi, aba bali nibalekhuulile; nibabakalusia muburukwi babe abasumba nabakholi beshikhasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako likhuwa liOMWAMI nilimwitsila Yeremia okhurula khuMWAMI; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "liri Kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Ndalakana nabakuuka beenywe indakano khunyanga eya ndabarusia mushialo shiaMisiri, okhurula munzu yobunyakhani; nimboola mbu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiyika olwa chilabeetsanga nichihweele musaafu, mulekhuule buli mundu omwana wabwe ouli omuHeburania ouba niyakhukusibwa, ne namalile okhukhukholela emiyika chisasaba; omulekhuule akhurulekhwo. Nebutswa abakuuka beenywe shibayambulila kata okhureka amarwi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neenyu mwali nimushiukhaane, nimukholanga akali amalayi mumoni tsianje, nimurumbulanga akobulekhuule, buli mundu khuwashie; khandi mwali nimulakaane ninasi indakano munzu eyo eyikulikhwa khuliira lianje; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa mwamala mushiukhane nimwonoonia eliira lianje, nimukaiusia buli mundu omusumbawe nabuli mundu omukholiwe oweshikhasi, aba mwali nimulekhuulile shinga olwa bachama; nimubakalusia muburukwi, okhubeetsanga abasumba beenywe nabakholi beenywe beshikhasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola, mbu Shimwayambulila ta, okhurumbula akobulekhuuli, buli mundu khumwana wabwe nabuli mundu khuwashie; ne lole, isie emurumbulila inywe obulekhuuli bundi, OMWAMI aboola; mbu khulukanga, nokhuluumbe, nokhunzala; ndalamukhola mube eshiriisio mubwami bwosi bweshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abandu abo abakhaya indakano yanje, nibaroosia amakhuwa keindakano eya bakhola imbeli wanje, ndalabakhola shinga eshimoosi eshia baarasia ebitonye bibili, nibabira hakari wabio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu abakhulundu baYuda nabakhulundu baYerusalemu, nabasumba abalate, nabakuhani, nabandu bosi beshialo, ababira hakari webitonye bieshimoosi tsana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalabahaana mumakhono kabasuku babwe, nomumakhono ka abo abayiima obulamu bwabwe; emilambo chiabwe nachio chilakwa ebiliibwa biamanyonyi akomwikulu nende tsisolo etsiomushialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Zedekia omuruchi waYuda, halala nabakhulundube, ndalabahaana mumakhono kabasuku babwe, nomumakhono ka abo abayiima obulamu bwabwe, mbu mumakhono kelihe liomuruchi waBabeli, elimurulilekhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, ndalalachilisia, OMWAMI aboola, nimbakalusia khwitookho lino; nabo balaliseera, nibalibukula, nibalisamba nomulilo; ne ndalakwisia amataala kaYuda amakunda, aharali abamenyamwo ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
